# Unblessed: Rewind (#433); first blessing awaits human review.
# message-kinds: a rewound Run's message goes back as it left the mailbox,
# whatever kind it is (ADR 0068). Each Rewind lands at board's `ping`.
# - A climbed message: d1 passed from knight to board; it goes back to
#   board's mailbox at the same place on its path, so knight doesn't see it
#   again (passed = 1).
# - An `error` message: board/r3's uncaught error queues one, and its Run is
#   rewound; it is dispatched again to `on error`.
# - A Host call of a Function Value: d4 runs tally in its Home Script, and is
#   called again after the Rewind, answering d4 once.
# Each rewound Segment's `add` rolls back, so n counts only the Runs that
# completed: 1 + 10 + 100.

